 font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">신청</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">도서관 홈페이지 로그인 </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">→ </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">도서검색 </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">→ </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">도서상세화면 클릭 </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">→ </span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">도서 내역 우측의</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">‘</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">온</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">’</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">버튼 클릭</span></strong></span><strong><br></strong></p><p style=\"margin-left: 109px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -81.7pt; line-height: 1.8;\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">→ </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">온라인 대출 예약 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(*</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">개인정보 수집동의 체크</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-left: 46px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -34.4pt; line-height: 1.8;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">보존서고 도서는 기존대로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">‘</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">보</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">’ </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">버튼 클릭하여 신청</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 63px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -47.2pt; line-height: 1.8;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ② </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span></strong></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">승인</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">온라인대출신청 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">승인 확인</span></strong></span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(알림 또는 메시지,</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;메일 발송</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 63px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -47.2pt; line-height: 1.8;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ③ </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span></strong></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">수령</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">지정된 시간</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">에 도서관 </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">층 대출데스크 방문 후 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">대출</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">- </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">10~11</span></strong></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">시</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, 15~17</span></strong></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">시</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 46px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -34.4pt; line-height: 1.8;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">일 내 미대출 시 신청 취소 처리함 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">/ </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>대출책 수 이내*</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">연체도서가 없는 경우에 이용 가능</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 46px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -34.4pt; line-height: 1.8;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-indent: -45.8667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-indent: -45.8667px;\"><em>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">* 온라인 대출예약 승인이 되어도 본인이 대출가능한 책수 안에서만 대출처리가 가능합니다.&nbsp;</span></em></u></p><p style=\"margin-right: 7px; line-height: 1.8;\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-right: 7px; line-height: 1.8;\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">3. </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">반납방법</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-right: 7px; line-height: 1.8;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">도서관 </span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">층 제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">자료실 대출데스크</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">에 방문하여 반납</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 7px; line-height: 1.8;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">도서관</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span></strong></span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">층 출입구 앞 수동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">목제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">반납함</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">을 통한 반납</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 7px; line-height: 1.8;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"color:#6633cc;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">자동반납함을 통한 반납 불가</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><br data-cke-eol=\"1\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
